<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Copene upgraded to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Copene upgraded to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said in a report it upgraded Brazilian petrochemical company Copene to hold from sell.</p>
<p>-- It said the market has over-reacted to weak fourth quarter results.</p>
<p>-- However, they maintained their pessimistic view on the sector over the next few years.</p>
<p>-- Copene preferred A shares ended at 340 reais Wednesday.</p>
<p>(-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415)</p>
